<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; }
        .content { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 30px; background: #667eea; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Welcome to UzSecure!</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
            <p>Welcome to UzSecure Bug Bounty Platform! We're excited to have you join our community of security researchers and companies working together to make Uzbekistan's digital infrastructure more secure.</p>
            <p>Your account has been successfully created. You can now:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Browse active bug bounty programs</li>
                <li>Submit vulnerability reports</li>
                <li>Earn rewards for valid findings</li>
                <li>Build your reputation in the security community</li>
            </ul>
            <p style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="button">Get Started</a>
            </p>
            <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>
            <p>Happy hunting!</p>
            <p><strong>The UzSecure Team</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2024 UzSecure. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
